            "dct:description": {
                "@language": "eng",
                "@value": "A distribution documenting trees protected for their exceptional and remarkable characteristics across the Grand-Duchy of Luxembourg based on CSV files. This distribution contains exact X/Y coordinates in the LUREF references system. This distribution contains all trees including those that Owners asked to hold confidential and that are only visible for Agents of the Administration de la nature et des forêts."
            },
